                      Type type,
                      Annotation[] annotations,
                      MediaType mediaType,
                      MultivaluedMap<String, String> httpHeaders,
                      InputStream entityStream) throws IOException {

        /*
         * Create a fresh Parser for each invocation to guarantee that the
         * ParserOptions are applied atomically before parsing begins.  Using
         * a shared Parser instance would require complex synchronization and
         * could lead to race conditions where options are changed after the
         * parse starts.
         */
